OL,3,GNEWSAClosed care home to be used as
OL,4,Ahomeless hostel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plan to turn an unused care home into
OL,7,Fa homeless hostel has been approved by
OL,8,Fa council.
OL,10,FWest Berkshire Council's project to
OL,11,Faccommodate up to 16 residents at the
OL,12,Fformer Chestnut Walk Care Home in
OL,13,FHungerford was approved on Wednesday.
OL,15,FResidents said they worried about the
OL,16,Fimpact of the facility and Hungerford
OL,17,FTown Council said it was concerned it
OL,18,Fcould change Chestnut Walk's
OL,19,Fresidential nature.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
