OL,3,GNEWSAClosed care home to be used as
OL,4,Ahomeless hostel
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the council said it would help
OL,7,F"provide accommodation closer to
OL,8,Fpeople's support networks, services and
OL,9,Fcommunities, while reducing reliance on
OL,10,Fother forms of temporary
OL,11,Faccommodation."
